n_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Icy_Burst#Icy_Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Icy Burst\">Icy Burst</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in icy cold, and deals 1 to 6 cold damage each hit. Critical hits deal an additional 1 to 10 cold damage for weapons with a x2 critical multiplier, 2 to 20 for a x3 multiplier and 3 to 30 for a x4 multiplier.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Snowstar.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Snowstar.png/420px-Snowstar.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"434\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Snowstar.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A perfectly formed icy crystal, razor-sharp and well-suited for throwing. Strange, it doesn't seem to melt.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230204\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3423/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23802/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4863/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time repor